# Forgotten Cellar: "When you unlock this door, you may cast spells from your graveyard this turn, and if a card would be
# put into your graveyard from anywhere this turn, exile it instead." Bot1 casts the door in turn 3; it enters unlocked
# and the ability triggers (CR 709.5d, 709.5h). Black Lotus, sacrificed to pay for it before the ability resolved, is in
# the graveyard and is cast from there; sacrificed again, it is exiled. The permission is about spells only (CR 305.9):
# Strip Mine, also in the graveyard, is not played from there though Bot1 has a land play left. In turn 5 both effects
# are gone, and the second Strip Mine goes to the graveyard.

